## Try it

- Menu → **Tools / Macros** → run **show-current-doc-as-markdown** on an open note.  
- **Help** → ask *“how can I create flashcards from my notes?”* → read the article → **Show me** when offered.  
- Menu → **Tool Catalog** → browse by category; star favorites for quick access.
